& [Need]
  + a strict validator cannot truthfully accept both a ten-name fence and numeric maximum nine
  + omitting one terminal transition would weaken commission consumption lease release or recovery accountability
  + implementation must therefore stop until corrected source custody replacement formation and a fresh signature exist

& [SmallestCorrectMove]
  + retain all ten ordered names and change only the erroneous numeric count and maximum to ten
  + preserve original source formation signature and evidence as historical truth and invalidate only new derivation authority
  + keep the seam pure so correction cannot become a pretext for physical broker authority

& [ProductValue]
  + exact one-use commission and fence shape is a prerequisite for a self-working host that can mutate safely under explicit accountability
  + mechanical cardinality equality gives later production and independent-review stages a stable executable contract

& [Boundary]
  + no production runner commission issuance consent lease ledger process filesystem Git preparation provider model MCP cleanup persistence activation D-drive WSL compaction or foreign effect
